{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3100_p", "source_sha256": "af2343646dd31a961404bd6c766d635a06438b9ca3cee5e7d738b73b66cc28a9", "ja": "エレナはスタイルがいいし、\nセクシー系の方が似合うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "艾琳娜的身材很好，\n性感路线的应该比较适合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3101_018ele", "source_sha256": "781033c64b557d97aba27ae62195f973962ce51adf10c5e5d621945fe2b857e2", "ja": "エヘヘ……♪　{$P$}に\nそう言われると、なんか照れちゃうネ？", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪听{$P$}这么说，\n感觉有点害羞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3102_018ele", "source_sha256": "0b54e5a0de9e195a6ddf2b14d5d6ed67c1fb4eff766926f2ed83ddff78363ecd", "ja": "わかったヨ！　みんなにも、セクシーだって\n言われるように、いーっぱいアピールしてくるネっ♪", "zh": "我知道了！为了让大家说我很性感，\n我会尽～情展现我的魅力喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3200_p", "source_sha256": "af2343646dd31a961404bd6c766d635a06438b9ca3cee5e7d738b73b66cc28a9", "ja": "エレナはスタイルがいいし、\nセクシー系の方が似合うんじゃないかな。", "zh": "艾琳娜的身材很好，\n性感路线的应该比较适合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3201_018ele", "source_sha256": "6284076d6148e3beb3dc0d654d3aa978826b8f1d43ca18585b0e7b3b967340ea", "ja": "オッケー！　セクシー系だネっ！\nそれじゃ、さっそく着替えるヨ～。", "zh": "OK！性感路线对吧！\n那么，马上来换衣服啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3202_018ele", "source_sha256": "ec1da57a31bbe49046eb84da8cfc27ae6014de4dd1e1d5b6f0b11f89fb95794c", "ja": "え？　ここで着替えちゃダメ？\nアハッ、そうだったネ！　いってくるヨ～♪", "zh": "咦？不可以在这里换衣服？\n啊哈，说得也是！我去换衣服啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3300_p", "source_sha256": "f54c3d2afb910e4eda3921131de4ecd4184195f8196576c5d27905cad85a7afe", "ja": "セクシー系もいいけど……\nたまにはキュート系にも挑戦してみようか。", "zh": "性感路线的也不错……\n但要不要偶尔也挑战可爱路线的试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3301_018ele", "source_sha256": "f811d6259820a2fb73c22cada7f24a91490677e8e8ac4309c5afe9f8d529be1e", "ja": "ワタシも、キュート系が着てみたいナって思ってたノ！\nエヘヘ……{$P$}、気が合うネ？", "zh": "我也想穿穿看可爱路线的服装喔！\n嘿嘿……{$P$}，我们真合拍呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3302_018ele", "source_sha256": "82eae73fc96e0a4534b89bae046b1d2c69b4675539a11f79c4248e049457cc08", "ja": "じゃあ、着替えてくるヨー。\n{$P$}、覗いちゃダメだからネ♪", "zh": "那我去换衣服啰～\n{$P$}，你不可以偷看喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3400_p", "source_sha256": "f54c3d2afb910e4eda3921131de4ecd4184195f8196576c5d27905cad85a7afe", "ja": "セクシー系もいいけど……\nたまにはキュート系にも挑戦してみようか。", "zh": "性感路线的也不错……\n但要不要偶尔也挑战可爱路线的试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3401_018ele", "source_sha256": "16ecc36065c5a28bf0ae13f173f42f33bafccf85cf4edb2d68fc997045ce3275", "ja": "そっかー。今日は、セクシー系で攻めてみても\nいいかナ？って思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊～我本来想今天要不要试着\n挑战用性感路线的服装表现自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_3402_018ele", "source_sha256": "b8461f4f362f60b510f2c7cb8c173dcb5dec4e99098e5eb6074a772b1c71f438", "ja": "でも{$P$}がそう言うなら、キュート\nな方を着てみるヨ。似合ってるか、チェックしてネ！", "zh": "但既然{$P$}这么说了，我就穿穿看\n可爱路线的服装吧。要帮我看我穿起来适不适合喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
